<view class="page"><view class="eyebrow">考吧167 / 共用账号</view><view class="title">网页账号</view><view class="subtitle">设置后，在手机或电脑浏览器登录，继续同一份训练。</view><view wx:if="{{error}}" class="error">{{error}}</view><view wx:if="{{notice}}" class="notice">{{notice}}</view><view class="card"><view class="label">学生账号</view><input class="input" value="{{username}}" data-field="username" bindinput="input" maxlength="100" placeholder="字母或数字，至少 3 位"/><block wx:if="{{webReady}}"><view class="label">原密码</view><input class="input" value="{{currentPassword}}" data-field="currentPassword" bindinput="input" password maxlength="128"/></block><view class="label">新密码</view><input class="input" value="{{password}}" data-field="password" bindinput="input" password maxlength="128" placeholder="至少 10 位"/><button bindtap="save" loading="{{busy}}" disabled="{{busy || password.length &lt; 10 || username.length &lt; 3}}">保存网页账号</button></view></view>